{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version of <i>The Spiral</i>, get an early look at the infinite dungeon and what awaits within. Explore and collect over 60 different items, fight deadly enemies, and challenge the boss to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will additionally feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More items to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More types of enemies to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More varied dungeon generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More bosses, including midbosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge runs to test your mettle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502400?t=1744762870","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502400/6a3fa94ee4087ad6f2b75476de072a9a5f6ed660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744762870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502400/7f2375480b2f0487eddc195c96c3bb8af662ffbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744762870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502400/7f2375480b2f0487eddc195c96c3bb8af662ffbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744762870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game depicts fantasy violence with some stylized blood."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version of <i>The Spiral</i>, get an early look at the infinite dungeon and what awaits within. Explore and collect over 60 different items, fight deadly enemies, and challenge the boss to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will a